- bit 26 = 1 (so third condition false: bits(machInst, 26) == 0 is false)
- bit 24 = 0, bits 31:28 = 0x1 (not 0xF)

So it should go to the else branch which calls `decodeFpAdvSIMD<GenericDecoder>`.

